Description: open-source TV box for the Raspberry Pi 5
 Couchbox turns a Raspberry Pi 5 into a TV box: KDE Plasma Bigscreen with a
 customizable home screen, native TV apps (Seerr, Twitch, Nebula, Dropout,
 2nd Try), YouTube, Jellyfin, AirPlay, HDMI-CEC TV control, Fire TV remote
 support with voice, and Settings for everything on the TV.
